**Ejercicio 1 — Leyes de De Morgan** (`ex.z`)

```scheme
(define de_morgan1
  (lambda (p q)
    (or (not p) (not q))))      ; NOT(P AND Q) ≡ (NOT P) OR (NOT Q)

(define de_morgan2
  (lambda (p q)
    (and (not p) (not q))))     ; NOT(P OR Q) ≡ (NOT P) AND (NOT Q)
```

